  "headline": "FDA's records show imipenem and cilastatin is not on the shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale East has 4 days on hand and the top rule option is a 55-vial transfer from Corvale Lakeside",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include imipenem and cilastatin as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 66 vials of the 500 mg + 500 mg injection with a daily use of 16.5 vials, giving 4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 105 vials with a daily use of 3.5 vials, giving 29.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The highest-ranked rule option is to transfer 55 vials of 500 mg + 500 mg from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would leave Lakeside with 14 days and bring East to 7 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternative option is to transfer 166 vials from Corvale General, which has 29.5 days on hand, to bring East to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A third option is to buy from Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on the FDA shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    }
  ]
}
